Description:
    Provides a web interface for uploading 'BIOM' files and generating
    interactive plots visualizing trends in alpha diversity, beta diversity,
    and taxa abundances through customizable box plots, PCoA ordinations, and
    heatmaps. Statistical annotations are added to denote significant
    correlations with metadata, enabling quick assessment of many variables.
    Generated data and figures can be exported as Excel-compatible spreadsheets
    and publication quality PDFs.
